      "id": 18,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Missing TCP SYN-ACKs (SYNs sent minus SYN-ACKs received)",
      "description": "SYNs the namespace's sources sent (as ${role}) minus the SYN-ACKs that came back to them: a connection attempt that never completes \u2014 a silent drop somewhere, a backend that is not listening, a policy on the far side. Cilium's own query from the Network Overview dashboard; the reply direction is matched by swapping source and destination.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
