  "description": "Policy verdicts from Hubble's `policy` dynamic metric (hubble_policy_verdicts_total): audit (observe first), forwarded (an allow rule matched), dropped (enforced), per namespace, with the drop metric beside them \u2014 and, since 0.3.0, the namespace's whole traffic around those verdicts: flows by verdict, drops of every reason, missing SYN-ACKs and echo replies, DNS queries, errors and missing answers (the panels of Cilium's Hubble Network Overview and DNS Overview namespace dashboards, on this page's namespace filter). Source: https://github.com/ephico2real2/hubble-policy-verdicts"
